  "description": "Delano and Jacob were childhood friends... until one day Delano catches Jacob getting intimate with Everett, Delano's brother! The two become enemies, but they somehow ended up as roommates in college. Delano is a popular jock, while Jacob is a nerdy loner with an aggressive potty-mouth. When Jacob catches the eye of Tristan, the campus flirt, Delano finally admits to himself that he's always had feelings for Jacob. Tristan has some dastardly plans for Jacob though... Will Delano save Jacob before it's too late? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
